@startuml campusmate_shared_base_url_configuration
title CampusMate Shared Base URL Configuration

' Source evidence:
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/application.yml:89-108
' pi-mono-java modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/mate/MateServiceModelManagerProvider.java:68-76
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeProperties.java:15-34
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/MateServiceClient.java:43-69 and 184-197
' mate-service src/main/java/com/huawei/hicampus/mate/agentdefinition/controller/AgentDefinitionController.java:38-67
' Observed behavior: Model Manager and Runtime clients read different base URL keys and can target different origins.
' Target-only design: both clients read campusmate.base-url while retaining separate paths, timeouts, and protocols.
' Architecture change: deployment owns one CampusMate origin and no child configuration can override its host.
' Security hardening: child paths are absolute service paths and cannot contain another origin.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

rectangle "Deployment Configuration" {
  component "campusmate.base-url\nCAMPUSMATE_BASE_URL\nHTTP(S) origin only" as BaseUrl
  component "campusmate.model-manager\nchat path, API, SSE timeouts" as ModelConfig
  component "campusmate.runtime\nAgent and Skill paths, short timeouts" as RuntimeConfig
}

rectangle "CampusClaw" {
  component "MateServiceModelManagerProvider\nWebClient and Chat SSE" as ModelClient
  component "MateServiceClient\nJDK HttpClient and ResultBean" as RuntimeClient
  component "MateToolClient\nseparate gateway client" as ToolClient
}

rectangle "CampusMate Service - Same Origin" {
  component "POST /mate-service/v1/LLM/chat" as ChatEndpoint
  component "GET /mate-service/v1/agents/{agentId}/runtime" as AgentEndpoint
  component "GET /mate-service/v1/skill/query/{skillId}" as SkillEndpoint
}

component "mate.innerGWSerive\nTool gateway - out of scope" as ToolGateway

BaseUrl --> ModelClient : same normalized origin
BaseUrl --> RuntimeClient : same normalized origin
ModelConfig --> ModelClient : path and transport options
RuntimeConfig --> RuntimeClient : paths and transport options
ModelClient --> ChatEndpoint : Chat JSON and SSE
RuntimeClient --> AgentEndpoint : runtime metadata
RuntimeClient --> SkillEndpoint : skill metadata
ToolClient --> ToolGateway : separate integration contract

note bottom of BaseUrl
The value is required and has no product default.
It contains scheme, host, and optional port only.
end note

note bottom of ToolGateway
Sharing the CampusMate origin does not merge
the existing Mate Tool gateway configuration.
end note
@enduml
